Package: wslc-remote
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: bash (>= 4.0), iproute2
Recommends: unfs3, curl | wget
Suggests: build-essential, flex, bison, pkgconf | pkg-config, libtirpc-dev, rpcsvc-proto
Maintainer: wslc-remote maintainers <noreply@example.invalid>
Homepage: https://github.com/craigloewen-msft/WSLc-remote
Description: NFS-accelerated drop-in for the WSL container CLI (wslc)
 Installs the wslc wrapper (and a "container" alias). Host bind mounts passed
 to "wslc run -v" are served to the container runtime VM over a loopback NFS
 export (UNFS3 unfsd) instead of the slower default virtiofs share.
 .
 Requires WSL with container support (wslc.exe). The unfsd server comes from
 the unfs3 package where the distribution has one; otherwise run
 "sudo wslc-build-unfsd" to build the official release.
